{"id":"f51848da1c79a8c0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel.md","title":"Cantor 闭类的可数秩稳定与完美核","display":"thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel — Cantor 闭类的可数秩稳定与完美核","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel","aliases":["20-thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel"],"display":"thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel — Cantor 闭类的可数秩稳定与完美核","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 8.7.8 的拓扑证明","source_printed_pages":[172],"source_pdf_pages":[205],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cantor-bendixson-kernel — Cantor 闭类的可数秩稳定与完美核"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 8.7.8 的拓扑证明"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>205</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 闭；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Perfect}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Perfect}(P)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 闭且没有孤立点，允许空集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cantor-bendixson-kernel}\\vdash\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\omega_1\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nC^{[\\beta]}=C^{[\\beta+1]}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\ (\\beta\\le\\alpha\\le\\omega_1\\Rightarrow C^{[\\alpha]}=C^{[\\beta]}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Perfect}(C^{[\\beta]})\\land|C\\setminus C^{[\\beta]}|\\le\\aleph_0,\\\\\nC^{[\\beta]}\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow|C^{[\\beta]}|=2^{\\aleph_0}\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cantor-bendixson-kernel}\\vdash\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\omega_1\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nC^{[\\beta]}=C^{[\\beta+1]}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\ (\\beta\\le\\alpha\\le\\omega_1\\Rightarrow C^{[\\alpha]}=C^{[\\beta]}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Perfect}(C^{[\\beta]})\\land|C\\setminus C^{[\\beta]}|\\le\\aleph_0,\\\\\nC^{[\\beta]}\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow|C^{[\\beta]}|=2^{\\aleph_0}\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>导集闭：不在导集的点有某个柱邻域在原闭类中为空或仅该点；同柱的其他点也不在导集。极限层交闭，且序列递减。每个严格下降的后继层可选最小代码柱，它在本层有孤立点而在下一层已空；不同下降阶段所选柱不同。若在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span> 都下降，便把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 注入可数柱集，矛盾，所以某个可数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 稳定。每层孤立点可注入柱集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 可数使全部被删点可数。非空完美闭类反复选择两不交的非空柱，构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 的连续单射；反向它是 Cantor 空间子集，所以基数等于连续统。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 8.7.8 的拓扑证明；印刷页 172；PDF 第 205 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Perfect}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cantor-bendixson-kernel}\\vdash\n\\exists\\beta<\\omega_1\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nC^{[\\beta]}=C^{[\\beta+1]}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\ (\\beta\\le\\alpha\\le\\omega_1\\Rightarrow C^{[\\alpha]}=C^{[\\beta]}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Perfect}(C^{[\\beta]})\\land|C\\setminus C^{[\\beta]}|\\le\\aleph_0,\\\\\nC^{[\\beta]}\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow|C^{[\\beta]}|=2^{\\aleph_0}\n\\end{gathered}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1930,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["14fc2af0ac27dcbb"]}